{
  "info": {
    "name": "Store API (public, no login)",
    "description": "Storefront API of the lean store. Customers have no accounts: nothing here needs a token. Run the requests in order: settings, catalogue, product detail (saves variant_id), quote, place order (saves order_number), look the order up; then the coupon, cart (saves cart_token) and bank transfer requests (14 to 28). Set base_url and product_slug.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/store"
    },
    {
      "key": "product_slug",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "variant_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "phone",
      "value": "+1 555 010 0100"
    },
    {
      "key": "idempotency_key",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "order_number",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "cart_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "coupon_code",
      "value": "SAVE10"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Store settings (start here)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/settings",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "settings"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "Store profile, open / closed, logo, footer, social links and agency credit, SEO, currency, tax, delivery method, payment methods and bank accounts, order limits and the theme (colours, fonts, radius, shadow). Call once on start-up."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Banners of a placement (home_hero: one banner or a slider)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/banners?placement=home_hero",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "banners"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "placement",
              "value": "home_hero"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Banners: promo strip",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/banners?placement=promo_strip",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "banners"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "placement",
              "value": "promo_strip"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Categories (tree, 2 levels)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/categories",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "categories"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Top categories (home screen)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/categories?top=1",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "categories"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "top",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Products",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/products?per_page=12&sort=popularity",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "products"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "per_page",
              "value": "12"
            },
            {
              "key": "sort",
              "value": "popularity"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Home section by tag",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/products?tag=best-seller&per_page=10",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "products"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "tag",
              "value": "best-seller"
            },
            {
              "key": "per_page",
              "value": "10"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "8. Search",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/products?q=cable&in_stock=1",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "products"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "q",
              "value": "cable"
            },
            {
              "key": "in_stock",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "9. Product detail (saves variant_id)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/products/{{product_slug}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "products",
            "{{product_slug}}"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "Set the product_slug variable first (a slug from request 6). Saves the first option as variant_id."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "if (d && d.variants && d.variants.length) { pm.collectionVariables.set('variant_id', d.variants[0].id); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "10. Quote: price the cart on the server",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"variant_id\": \"{{variant_id}}\",\n      \"qty\": 5\n    }\n  ]\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/checkout/quote",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "checkout",
            "quote"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "The storefront keeps the cart; this prices it (bulk prices, tax, delivery fee, warnings). Nothing is stored or reserved. No login."
      },
      "event": []
    },
    {
      "name": "11. Place a guest order (cash on delivery, saves order_number)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Idempotency-Key",
            "value": "{{idempotency_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"customer\": {\n    \"name\": \"Alex Morgan\",\n    \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n    \"email\": \"alex@example.com\"\n  },\n  \"address\": {\n    \"line1\": \"12 Example Street\",\n    \"area\": \"Downtown\",\n    \"city\": \"Springfield\",\n    \"state\": \"Sample State\",\n    \"postcode\": \"12345\",\n    \"country\": \"Testland\"\n  },\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"variant_id\": \"{{variant_id}}\",\n      \"qty\": 5\n    }\n  ],\n  \"customer_note\": \"Call before delivery\",\n  \"website\": \"\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "orders"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "No login. phone is required, email optional. Idempotency-Key: a retry with the same key returns the same order (200 + Idempotency-Replayed). `website` is the honeypot field: leave it empty. 409 price_changed when expected_total no longer matches."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('idempotency_key', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 201 || pm.response.code === 200) { pm.collectionVariables.set('order_number', pm.response.json().data.order_number); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "12. Look the order up (order number + phone)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_number}}?phone={{phone}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "orders",
            "{{order_number}}"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "phone",
              "value": "{{phone}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Status, items, totals, tracking and timeline. A wrong phone answers 404, exactly like an unknown order."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "13. Look up with a wrong phone (expect 404)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_number}}?phone=+1 555 010 9999",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "orders",
            "{{order_number}}"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "phone",
              "value": "+1 555 010 9999"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "14. Quote with a coupon and a delivery address",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/checkout/quote",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "checkout",
            "quote"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "Items or cart_token, an optional coupon_code, the address fields delivery zones match on (city, area, postcode) and an optional phone (so the per-customer and first-order coupon rules can be checked). A refused coupon is explained in summary.coupon_error and does not block the quote. delivery_fee is null while it is not known (zones without an address, owner_confirms).",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"variant_id\": \"{{variant_id}}\",\n      \"qty\": 5\n    }\n  ],\n  \"coupon_code\": \"{{coupon_code}}\",\n  \"address\": {\n    \"city\": \"Springfield\",\n    \"area\": \"Downtown\",\n    \"postcode\": \"12345\"\n  },\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\"\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "15. Coupon: validate a code (the quote with the coupon applied)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/coupons/validate",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "coupons",
            "validate"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "200 = the quote with the coupon applied. A coupon that does not work answers 422 { code: \"coupon_invalid\", coupon_error: { code, message } }. 30 a minute per IP.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{coupon_code}}\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"variant_id\": \"{{variant_id}}\",\n      \"qty\": 1\n    }\n  ],\n  \"address\": {\n    \"city\": \"Springfield\"\n  }\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "16. Cart: get (creates a cart and saves cart_token)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Cart-Token",
            "value": "{{cart_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "cart"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "Customers have no login: the cart belongs to a random token. Without the X-Cart-Token header (or with an unknown / expired one) a new empty cart is created; data.token is saved to the cart_token variable. Optional ?city=&area=&postcode= gives the delivery fee of a zone. Prices and stock are checked on every read."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.collectionVariables.set('cart_token', pm.response.json().data.token); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "17. Cart: add an item",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Cart-Token",
            "value": "{{cart_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart/items",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "cart",
            "items"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "Adds qty to the option (on top of the existing quantity). Answers the priced cart (same shape as the quote plus token, contact, expires_at).",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"variant_id\": \"{{variant_id}}\",\n  \"qty\": 2\n}"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.collectionVariables.set('cart_token', pm.response.json().data.token); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "18. Cart: set the quantity of a line",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Cart-Token",
            "value": "{{cart_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart/items/{{variant_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "cart",
            "items",
            "{{variant_id}}"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "Sets the quantity (404 not_in_cart when the option is not in the cart).",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"qty\": 3\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "19. Cart: remove a line",
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Cart-Token",
            "value": "{{cart_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart/items/{{variant_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "cart",
            "items",
            "{{variant_id}}"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "Removes the line."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "20. Cart: save the contact",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Cart-Token",
            "value": "{{cart_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart/contact",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "cart",
            "contact"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "Kept so the shop can follow up. Only the keys that are sent change.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Alex Morgan\",\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"email\": \"alex@example.com\"\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "21. Cart: apply a coupon",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Cart-Token",
            "value": "{{cart_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart/coupon",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "cart",
            "coupon"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "A code that does not work answers 422 coupon_invalid and is not saved.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{coupon_code}}\"\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "22. Cart: remove the coupon",
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Cart-Token",
            "value": "{{cart_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart/coupon",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "cart",
            "coupon"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "23. Cart: empty it",
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Cart-Token",
            "value": "{{cart_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "cart"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "Empties items and coupon; the contact stays."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "24. Quote the cart (cart_token instead of items)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/checkout/quote",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "checkout",
            "quote"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "Uses the cart items, the cart coupon and the saved phone. items win when both are sent. An unknown or expired token prices an empty cart.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"cart_token\": \"{{cart_token}}\"\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "25. Place an order from the cart (cart_token)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Idempotency-Key",
            "value": "{{idempotency_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "orders"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "The items and the coupon come from the cart; on success the cart is emptied in the same transaction, a failed order leaves it as it was. 422 cart_invalid for an empty, unknown or expired cart.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"customer\": {\n    \"name\": \"Alex Morgan\",\n    \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n    \"email\": \"alex@example.com\"\n  },\n  \"address\": {\n    \"line1\": \"12 Example Street\",\n    \"area\": \"Downtown\",\n    \"city\": \"Springfield\",\n    \"state\": \"Sample State\",\n    \"postcode\": \"12345\",\n    \"country\": \"Testland\"\n  },\n  \"cart_token\": \"{{cart_token}}\",\n  \"customer_note\": \"Call before delivery\",\n  \"website\": \"\"\n}"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('idempotency_key', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 201 || pm.response.code === 200) { pm.collectionVariables.set('order_number', pm.response.json().data.order_number); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "26. Place a bank transfer order (saves order_number)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Idempotency-Key",
            "value": "{{idempotency_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "orders"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
